{
  "info": {
    "name": "BedLink API",
    "description": "End-to-end checks for the BedLink backend (58 requests, ~110 assertions).\n\n1. In .env set LOGIN_RATE_LIMIT_PER_MINUTE=100 (the collection logs in ~14 times; the default limit is 10/min) and restart the server.\n2. Run `npm run seed` (fresh demo data) before every full run.\n3. Run the whole collection in order with the Collection Runner.\n\nPostman keeps the bl_token cookie; each 'Login as \u2026' request switches the user. IDs are saved into collection variables automatically.",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "01 Health & auth",
      "description": "Login, wrong password, RBAC.",
